{"case": "c30", "fields": {"people": [{"value": "the actual participator in the ghostly seance", "quote": "the actual participator in the ghos.ly seance"}]}, "choice": {"people": "B"}, "reason": "The text, cut off before the witness is named, never says the lady from the East saw the vision, so per the fields rule the value is not inferred and the person is the one the text describes, the actual participator.", "rule10": null}
{"case": "c31", "fields": {"seen": {"value": "communications from the spirit Patience, by ouija board and without it", "quote": "the communications of Patience"}}, "choice": {"seen": "B"}, "reason": "What was experienced is Patience's communications, by board and without it, and the communications of Patience is the span that states them as a whole.", "rule10": null}
{"case": "c32", "kind": "other", "kind_quote": "me ever active spirit Of our people", "fields": {}, "choice": {"kind": "A"}, "reason": "The active spirit of our people is spirit as character, which rule 10's last bullet makes other, and the railroad editorial has no ghost matter.", "rule10": {"without_v3_bullet": "other", "bullet_right": true, "why": "Spirit as a people's character is a literal ordinary sense, not a figure of speech built on ghosts, so I would rule other even without the bullet."}}
{"case": "c33", "kind": "other", "kind_quote": "their club Is the medium through which they expect to obtain them", "fields": {}, "choice": {"kind": "B"}, "reason": "Medium as a means and a spirit of philanthropy as a mood are ordinary senses, which rule 10's last bullet makes other.", "rule10": {"without_v3_bullet": "other", "bullet_right": true, "why": "Neither medium as a means nor spirit as a disposition evokes a ghost, so neither is a ghost figure of speech even without the bullet."}}
