{"case": "c35", "fields": {"people": [{"value": "a number of people returning from a social affair", "quote": "number of people returning from a social affair"}, {"value": "the people of the neighborhood", "quote": "The people of the neigh borhood"}]}, "choice": {"people": "B"}, "reason": "People are those who saw or claimed it: the returning party saw the form and the neighbourhood people claim the cemetery is haunted, while Dr. Peterson was the cause, not a witness.", "rule10": null}
